  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_2_0621" name="Here are two concise transition options:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Direct):**&#10;&gt; The parts successfully procured and managed in Process A become the available inventory stock, which Process B's fulfillment system then checks when an order is placed.&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Slightly broader):**&#10;&gt; Once parts are acquired, built into products (implied by &quot;start building&quot;), and maintained in stock per Process A, they become the inventory that Process B accesses to fulfill customer orders." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_2" sourceRef="atom_1_ExclusiveGateway_9" targetRef="Bridge_2_0621" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_2" sourceRef="Bridge_2_0621" targetRef="atom_2_Task_25" /></bpmn:process>
